**Localized News App for Tax Reform Proposal**

This iOS Swift app will provide users with localized news updates tailored to their demographics, aiming to influence public opinion on a tax reform proposal.

**Project Structure**

* `LocalizedNewsApp`
	+ `NewsService.swift`: Responsible for fetching news articles from a backend API
	+ `Demographics.swift`: Handles user demographics and provides relevant news articles
	+ `NewsArticle.swift`: Represents a single news article
	+ `ViewController.swift`: The main view controller for the app
	+ `AppDelegate.swift`: Handles app-wide settings and notifications

